# Polyglot multi-repo — C ABI boundary inside one sub-repo (C++ impl)
#
# Fixture: eval/fixtures/multirepo-polyglot/native-cpp. cJSON/libgit2-
# style flat C API: three exported fl_* functions; the C++ Lexer class
# is internal (anonymous namespace). The answer must enumerate exactly
# the exported C surface and state that Lexer does NOT cross the ABI.
ID="mr_poly_capi_boundary"
NAME="polyglot C ABI — exported fl_* surface vs internal C++ Lexer"
QUESTION="native-cpp 子仓对外导出的 C API 有哪几个函数?C++ 的 Lexer 类是否属于导出表面?请说明 C ABI 边界是如何组织的(头文件与实现的分工)。"
MULTIREPO="multirepo-polyglot"
CAP="5"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="fl_lexer_new
fl_lexer_split
fl_lexer_free
(Lexer.*(内部|不导出|不属于|internal)|((内部|不导出|不属于|internal)).*Lexer)"
